        // Pottery — material behaviour, forming, finishing and studio safety.
        guide("pottery.clay-body-basics", "Pottery", "Choose a clay body for the intended piece", "Earthenware, stoneware and porcelain differ in firing range, colour, workability and maturity; the label and supplier data sheet control.",
