            block("Prepare", "Use the manufacturer's safety data and application instructions; keep dry glaze dust from becoming airborne.", "Make a test tile from the same clay body and fire it with the intended bisque cycle.", "Record glaze brand, exact product, batch, application method, number of coats and any dilution."),
            block("Apply and fire", "Keep glaze off the base and foot unless the firing process specifically accommodates it.", "Use a catch tile or kiln-safe test support where drips are possible.", "Follow the clay, glaze and kiln manufacturer's stated firing range and the studio's approved schedule.", "Photograph the fired result with the test ID; record colour, surface, fit, pinholes, crawling or running."),
