            sources = listOf("Digitalfire — glaze and ceramic materials reference" to "https://digitalfire.com/"), related = listOf("pottery.glaze-test", "pottery.kiln-safety")),
        guide("pottery.kiln-safety", "Pottery", "Kiln and studio safety essentials", "A kiln is a high-temperature electrical appliance; use the studio's trained procedures and the exact kiln manual.",
            block("Before firing", "Check the kiln, plug, cable, ventilation, controller and firing area for visible damage; report issues rather than improvising repairs.", "Use only approved shelves, posts and loading patterns. Keep combustible items and walkways clear.", "Confirm clay and glaze compatibility, load dryness, firing program and any required witness cones with the responsible technician."),
